      "canonicalType": "Formula",
      "label": "\\Delta_{1}=a_{1}>0, \\quad \\Delta_{2}=\\left|\\begin{array}{ll}\na_{1} & a_{3} \\\\\na_{0} & a_{2}\n\\end{array}\\right|>0, \\quad \\Delta_{3}=\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}\na_{1} & a_{3} & a_{5} \\\\\na_{0} & a_{2} & a_{4} \\\\\n0 & a_{1} & a_{3}\n\\end{array}\\right|>0, \\quad \\cdots, \\quad \\Delta_{n}>0",
